; A slider's track is drawn at the height of THIS stylebox's minimum size, and
; a StyleBoxFlat with no content margins has a minimum size of zero. Without
; these four lines the track and its fill both render as a hairline: the three
; volume sliders in Settings were a single 4px dot on an empty row, with no
; visible track, no fill and nothing to suggest they could be dragged.
[sub_resource type="StyleBoxFlat" id="StyleBoxFlat_slider_track"]
