; Sliding overlays (the Forge, the Relics list, the Upgrade shop) COVER the
; screen behind them rather than floating over a scrim, so unlike every other
; PanelContainer they have to be fully opaque. At the shared alpha the Gear
; inventory list showed straight through the Forge's own header, which reads as
; a rendering fault rather than as depth.
[sub_resource type="StyleBoxFlat" id="StyleBoxFlat_overlay_panel"]
